  "chitchat": [],
  "description": "Marla runs the Coyote's from behind the long bar with the calm of someone who has watched every kind of trouble walk in and buried a couple of them out back. She'll pour you anything and remember everything: who's flush, who's marked, who came in on Cass's last plane. Outsiders get one honest drink and a long, patient look before she decides what they are.",
